00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:45.850
I did. But we measured heart 
rate before, didn't we?

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:49.270
This alone won't serve as 
absolute proof of love.

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:51.780
It's elevated.

