00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:28.260
I don't understand.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:33.440
Why are people so eager to join together 
organs meant for food intake?

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:36.660
Wanting to bring internal organs 
into contact with each other

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:38.730
is a biological instinct, isn't it?

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:41.180
Reproductive actions would 
be sufficient for that.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:43.050
You say that, but...

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:45.530
Yukimura-kun, you kissed me, didn't you?

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:49.250
