experiment, so I had no choice!

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:52.640
It was not done out of 
some animalistic drive!

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:54.220
As a necessary...

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:02.420
Here. You take a saliva 
sample, too, Yukimura-kun.

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.850
Gathering more data is always better, right?

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:07.140
It might come in useful one day.

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:09.870
